   532	       .claude/worktrees/feat-<FEAT-ID>-<feature-name> HEAD
   533	
   534	Next:
   535	  1. Review the spec — check Acceptance Criteria and Architectural Design.
   536	  2. Mark status: approved when ready.
   537	  3. Run /sdd-task sdd/specs/<feature-name>.spec.md
   538	```
   539	
   540	**`TYPE == "hotfix"` (FEAT-466 — no id reserved):**
