   178	   ledger id at all (same rationale as `/sdd-spec` §5's `FEAT-<NNN>` skip).
   179	   Number tasks **locally within this spec only**, as
   180	   `HOTFIX-<JIRA-KEY>-1`, `HOTFIX-<JIRA-KEY>-2`, … — these are literal
   181	   string ids scoped to this hotfix's own index file, never compared
   182	   against or drawn from `sdd/tasks/.id_ledger.json`'s `TASK-<NNN>`
   183	   namespace. (Note: this is the defensive path for the rare case a human
   184	   runs `/sdd-task` directly against a hotfix spec — the *normal* hotfix
   185	   flow skips `/sdd-task` entirely; see §1 above.)
