   251	INDEX="sdd/tasks/index/<feature-slug>.json"
   252	mkdir -p "$(dirname "$INDEX")"
   253	```
   254	
   255	**Field clarification:**
   256	- `feature_id`: Formal Feature ID from the spec (e.g., `"FEAT-014"`).
   257	  **`null` for a hotfix** (FEAT-466 — no id reserved); use `jira_issue_key`
