   259	- `feature`: Kebab-case slug (e.g., `"videoreel-visual-changes"`).
   260	
   261	### 5. Commit Tasks and Per-Spec Index to `<BASE>`
   262	
   263	> **CRITICAL — Only commit the per-spec index and the new task files. NEVER
   264	> commit unrelated changes.** Other files may be modified or unstaged in the
