   282	# If ANY other files appear, run "git reset HEAD" and start over
   283	
   284	# 4. Commit
   285	git commit -m "sdd: add <N> tasks for FEAT-<ID> — <feature-name>"
   286	```
   287	
   288	### 6. Create the Worktree
   289	
   290	After committing to `<BASE>`, create the worktree so it inherits the tasks.
   291	Naming and base ref depend on `TYPE` (FEAT-466 — a hotfix has no reserved
   292	id, so it is named from its Jira key, and always branches from
   293	`origin/main`, never `HEAD`):
   294	
   295	```bash
