   191	| Finding | Disposition | Reason |
   192	|---------|-------------|--------|
   193	| <Reviewer finding> | CONFIRM / REJECT / ESCALATE | <why> |
   194	```
   195	
   196	## Response Format
   197	
   198	```markdown
   199	## Code Review Summary
   200	[Brief overview: what was reviewed, overall verdict: ✅ Approved | ⚠ Approved with notes | ❌ Needs changes]
   201	
   202	## Critical Issues 🔴
   203	[Security vulnerabilities, async violations, production-breaking issues]
