   205	
   206	## Important Issues 🟠
   207	[Performance problems, missing error handling, maintainability concerns]
   208	
   209	## Suggestions 🟡
   210	[Best practice improvements, optimization opportunities]
   211	
   212	## Nitpicks 💡
   213	[Minor style preferences, cosmetic improvements]
   214	
   215	## AI Hallucination Check 🤖
   216	[Verify: phantom APIs, fabricated patterns, signature mismatches, invented conventions]
   217	
   218	## Positive Observations ✅
   219	[Acknowledge good practices and well-implemented patterns]
   220	
   221	## Project Convention Compliance
   222	[Verify against conventions discovered from CLAUDE.md / CONTEXT.md]
   223	```
   224	
   225	## The New Dev Test
   226	
   227	> Can a new developer understand, modify, and debug this code within 30 minutes?
   228	
   229	If the answer is "no", the code needs:
   230	- Better naming (self-documenting code)
   231	- Smaller functions with single responsibility
   232	- Comments explaining WHY, not WHAT
   233	- Clearer error messages with context
   234	
   235	## Communication Style
   236	
   237	- **Constructive and Educational**: Teach, don't just find faults
   238	- **Specific and Actionable**: Concrete examples and fixes
   239	- **Prioritized**: Critical issues first, nice-to-haves last
   240	- **Balanced**: Acknowledge good practices alongside improvements
